defaults:
  normalization: rank
  scaling: none
  reduction: none
  component_mode: variance
  n_components: 3
  variance_ratio: 0.90
  correlation_filter: none
  max_abs_correlation: 0.50
  min_features: 3
selector_fields:
  normalization: {label: 截面归一化}
  scaling: {label: 训练期缩放}
  reduction: {label: 降维}
  component_mode: {label: PCA 维数设置}
  correlation_filter: {label: PCA 前相关性去冗余}
correlation_filter:
  none: {label: 不筛选相关性}
  greedy: {label: 训练期按因子顺序剔除高相关项}
normalization:
  rank: {label: 每日截面排名}
  zscore: {label: 每日截面 Z-score}
  minmax: {label: 每日截面 Min-Max}
  none: {label: 保留原始因子}
scaling:
  none: {label: 不额外缩放}
  standard: {label: 训练期 StandardScaler}
  minmax: {label: 训练期 MinMaxScaler}
  robust: {label: 训练期 RobustScaler}
reduction:
  none: {label: 不降维}
  pca: {label: PCA 主成分分析}
component_modes:
  variance: {label: 按累计解释方差保留}
  count: {label: 指定主成分数量}
numeric_fields:
  n_components: {label: PCA 主成分数量, min: 1, max: 40, step: 1}
  variance_ratio: {label: PCA 累计解释方差比例, min: 0.90, max: 0.9999, step: 0.01}
  max_abs_correlation: {label: 因子最大绝对相关系数, min: 0.01, max: 0.99, step: 0.01}
  min_features: {label: 去冗余后最少因子数, min: 2, max: 40, step: 1}
note: 相关性筛选、缩放器与 PCA 仅在训练期拟合，验证期只转换。相关性为归一化输入的Pearson绝对值，按配置因子顺序优先保留。90%解释方差针对去冗余后保留的因子，不代表原候选全集或收益解释率。
